The corrected mobile hub now keeps “Back to map” in its own row, while the lesson rail can still center the current lesson. The final screenshot set is overflow-free at 390 and 1440; I’m doing a reduced-motion and 44px target audit across all eight representative routes before the prescribed build/test/smoke sequence.
